@startuml

[*] --> AccountCreated : Create Account
AccountCreated --> LoggedIn : Log In
LoggedIn --> VisaApplied : Apply For Visa
VisaApplied --> StatusViewed : View Status
StatusViewed --> CheckStatus : Check Status
CheckStatus --> StatusViewed : Re-View Status
LoggedIn --> CancelApplication : Cancel Application
LoggedIn --> ModifyDetails : Modify Details
LoggedIn --> ViewDetails : View Details
LoggedIn --> ViewPurpose : View Purpose
anyState --> FeedbackGiven : Give Feedback
anyState except AccountCreated --> LoggedIn : Log Out

@enduml
